 style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px', 'Sans',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Investment commitments are $11.4&#160;billion as of January&#160;25, 2026, subject to certain contingencies, of which we expect substantially all will be made through fiscal year 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'NVIDIA Sans',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Other commitments were $3.4&#160;billion as of January&#160;25, 2026, of which the majority will be paid through fiscal year 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#76b900;font-family:'NVIDIA Sans',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Accrual for Product Warranty Liabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'NVIDIA Sans',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The estimated amount of product warranty liabilities was $2.8 billion and $1.3 billion as of January&#160;25, 2026 and January&#160;26, 2025, respectively. The estimated product returns and product warranty activity consisted of the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:44.806%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:16.443%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.530%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:16.443%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&l